{"id":"vod_sn_37470","vodId":"37470","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"特搜战队刑事连者","name_cn":"特搜战队刑事连者","date":"2004-01-01","year":"2004","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/9e2588e9654a7a2a4c6b2b1ef10f7500.jpg"},"summary":"全50话。　　宇宙中星球间的来往已实现，地球人和外星人之间的交流也不再稀奇的时代里，犯罪的型态也有所改变。一些地球人没有的特殊能力及科学技术被用于犯罪，而这些犯罪却已超过了地球的警察的处理能力。为了取缔这些犯罪，星球间成立了SPECIAL POLICE DEKARENGER（略称SPD）宇宙警察组织。　　本篇故事的发展始于巨人种外星人的巴士挟持事件。犯人虽然很快的被户增宝儿(DekaBlue)所率领的宇宙警察地球署的刑警们所逮捕，但在询问过程中发现他持有地球上不存在的金属。为追查其下落，地球署的刑警们开始展开进一步的搜查。搜查过程中虽出现了一名情报提供者，但却不幸被暗杀。这名暗杀犯使用多数的人造人试图逃离现场时，被一名发型奇特的刑警所逮捕，而这名发型奇特的刑警就是新被派到地球署的新刑警赤座伴番(DekaRed)。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:52:45","playable":true,"episodeCount":50,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/WJEBK0ts5i1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/ZJucjbUabF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/aqvtq9pKX01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/fDB0ZRGifW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/EUzq3X25wF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/gdJeG57GqE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/s5idiLV4ZH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/6BmnFXNgvF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/XWv7r7s0i51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/UfZkWbRx181/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/9grHrFA4Hi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/1U2shLNQYB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/8SzrGpP7kd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","u